-    VIZ2["browser viz — baked path<br/>baked.ts shim fetches chunks,<br/>re-encodes to synthetic TSSF<br/>→ same render loop"]
-
-    REC --> P --> VIZ1
-    REC --> RS
-    ART --> HOST --> VIZ2
